  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to medium-high heat, about 400°F.",
    "Cut the rested tofu into 1-inch cubes.",
    "Thread a piece of rested tofu, a few strands of lemongrass, and a piece of katsuobushi onto a skewer.",
    "Brush the skewers with soy sauce, maple syrup, rice vinegar, grain mustard, and honey.",
    "Season the skewers with smoked salt and black pepper.",
    "Grill the skewers for 3-4 minutes per side, or until the katsuobushi is caramelized.",
    "Remove the skewers from the grill and sprinkle with fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
